# Evidence archives never enter the repo ([USER 2026-09-06]: "These should
# not be git committed, and will not be pushed ... The important thing is
# that runs can be reconstructed"). Identities of dropped archives live in
# the evidence directories' SHA256SUMS.dropped; runs are reconstructed from
# the recipes in their READMEs. Deliberately NO *.json ignore: inventories
# and summaries stay tracked.
